    // ---- The staff import, on the shared panel (2026-09-18) ------------------------------------
    // What used to live here — a file input, a CSV textarea, a hand-rolled header map, a preview
    // table, a progress card and a System.Threading.Timer polling every second — is now QImportPanel.
    // The polling in particular had no reason to exist: the server has always broadcast this job's
    // progress over SignalR, and the student roster page has always listened to it. This page simply
    // landed later and hand-rolled a second mechanism for the same events.

    /// <summary>
    /// The columns, with the spellings a real school's spreadsheet uses. This list is also the
    /// downloadable template, so the file somebody gets and the file this page can read are the
    /// same thing by construction.
    /// </summary>
